### Important Cleanup
You have an extra const displayTime = ... line floating at the top of your component (around line 512). **Delete that line**. It was trying to access variables that hadn't been defined yet, which caused the ReferenceError.
By defining effectiveScheduledTime and displayTime inside the .map() loop, the code is now perfectly scoped and will no longer crash.
